HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0137.fits, spectra0138.fits,          HISTORY spectra0139.fits, spectra0140.fits, spectra0141.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0142.fits, spectra0143.fits, spectra0144.fits were               HISTORY combined using a robust weighted mean with a sigma threshold of         HISTORY 8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale factors were determined         HISTORY using order 1 and are: 1.0062026096235508, 0.9938733922883533,          HISTORY 1.0091212203584408, 0.8678240280151416, 0.98099197711601,               HISTORY 1.2413564361744653, 1.0728319877105337, 0.8177997253282596.             END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             